          "id": "roblox-launches-creator-program-for-devs-to-bring-games-to-i",
          "title": "**Roblox** launches creator program for devs to bring games to its platform for free",
          "body": null,
          "url": "https://www.gamesindustry.biz/roblox-launches-creator-program-for-devs-to-bring-games-to-its-platform-for-free",
          "source": {
            "name": "GamesIndustry.biz",
            "domain": "gamesindustry.biz"
          },
          "metadata": {
            "story_type": "confirmed",
            "importance": "normal"
          },
          "bullets": [
            "Developers with games built on any engine, including Unity and Unreal, can apply to have Roblox convert their titles to the platform.",
            "The program will initially include a limited group of developers and games across mobile, PC, and console. Approved developers will be asked to provide their source code and assets.",
            "Roblox will handle the conversion at no cost, and developers will retain ownership of their game, intellectual property, and the Roblox version."
          ]
        },
